        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/gossamerica/{size}/4844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-15T23:21:31.865Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ve previously used Haka to collect all of the targets from Gloomweaver &amp; Voss’s decks, leaving them nothing to do (except, in the case of Voss, make some pitiful attempts to fight).</p>\n<p>Right now, I’m letting the Final Wasteland empty Voss’s deck, with Environmental Allies protecting the heroes, and Dr. Medico actually healing Voss to keep him from dying at the claws of the cryptids.  And Omnitron-X is helping Voss get through his deck more quickly…</p>",
